Error [jet.MoveWithoutMarker]: Implicit clone of `value`
  --> plain_parameter_write_take_and_escape_diagnostics_name_explicit_access_2.jet:3:33
    |
  3 | fn relay<T>(value: T) { consume(value) }
    |                                 ^^^^^
 Why: `consume` expects to take ownership of this value
 Fix: Write the move marker `^` (`^value`) if this is the last use, or copy first with `value.copy()`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0209
